          <th style=\"width: 25%;\">REG</th>\n                            <th>合算</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>1/348.6</td>\n                            <td>1/524.3</td>\n                            <td>1/209.4</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>1/341.3</td>\n                            <td>1/448.9</td>\n                            <td>1/193.9</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>1/313.6</td>\n                            <td>1/360.1</td>\n                            <td>1/167.6</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>1/290.0</td>\n                            <td>1/290.0</td>\n                            <td>1/145.0</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </section>\n\n            <section>\n                <h3>出玉率</h3>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 25%;\">設定</th>\n                            <th>出玉率</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>98.0%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>100.5%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>103.0%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>107.0%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                \n            </section>\n\n            \n        </div>\n\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu2\">打ち方・リール配列</p>\n        <div class=\"contents2\">\n            <p class=\"js-menu3\">配当表</p>\n            <div class=\"contents3\">\n                <section>\n                    <h3>配当表</h3>\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/jackpot__2.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                </section>\n\n                <section>\n                    <h3>有効ライン</h3>\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/yuukouline1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                </section>\n\n                \n            </div>\n\n            <p class=\"js-menu3\">リール配列</p>\n            <div class=\"contents3\">\n                <section>\n                    <h3>リール配列</h3>\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/jackpot__1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                </section>\n\n                \n            </div>\n\n            <p class=\"js-menu3 open2\" id=\"destination2\">通常時の打ち方</p>\n            <div class=\"contents3\">\n                <section>\n                    <h3>通常時の打ち方</h3>\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/jackpot__3.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    <p>左リール上段に<b>BAR</b>を狙い、中・右リールはフリー打ち。</p>\n                </section>\n\n                \n            </div>\n\n            <p class=\"js-menu3\">ボーナス入賞手順</p>\n            <div class=\"contents3\">\n                <section>\n                    <h3>概要</h3>\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/jackpot__12.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    <p>ボーナス当選告知が発生した後は、リール枠上が点滅したタイミングで、全リールに<b class=\"red\">赤7</b>狙い。</p>\n                    \n                </section>\n\n                \n            </div>\n\n            <p class=\"js-menu3\" id=\"destination6\">ボーナス中の打ち方</p>\n            <div class=\"contents3\">\n                <section>\n                    <h3>ボーナス中の打ち方</h3>\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/jackpot__13.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    <p>ボーナス中は一度だけナビに従い逆押しで消化し、枚数調整を行いましょう。</p>\n                    <p>上記手順後は順押しフリー打ちで消化することで、最大枚数を獲得することが可能です。</p>\n                </section>\n\n                \n            </div>\n\n            <p class=\"js-menu3\">小役の停止形</p>\n            <div class=\"contents3\">\n                <section>\n                    <h3>小役の停止形</h3>\n                    <table border=\"1\">\n                        <tbody>\n                            <tr>\n                                <th style=\"width: 50%;\">チェリー</th>\n                                <th>スイカ</th>\n                            </tr>\n                            <tr>\n                                <td class=\"bg-white\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/jackpot__4.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                </td>\n                                <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/jackpot__5.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                </td>\n                            </tr>\n                            <tr>\n                                <th>リーチ目</th>\n                                <th>リーチ目</th>\n                            </tr>\n                            <tr>\n                                <td class=\"bg-white\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/jackpot__6.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                </td>\n                 